                            <span begin="02:37.508" end="02:38.357" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kanashi</span>
                            <span begin="02:38.357" end="02:38.677" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">i</span>
                        </text>
                        <text for="L32">
                            <span begin="02:38.704" end="02:39.354" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">hontouha</span>
                            <span begin="02:39.354" end="02:39.785" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">dare ka</span>
                            <span begin="02:39.785" end="02:40.089" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mi</span>
                            <span begin="02:40.089" end="02:40.462" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">tai</span>
                            <span begin="02:40.462" end="02:40.902" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ni</span>
                        </text>
                        <text for="L33">
                            <span begin="02:40.915" end="02:41.765" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kou</span>
                            <span begin="02:41.765" end="02:42.298" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">se ni</span>
                            <span begin="02:42.298" end="02:42.439" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">na</span>
                            <span begin="02:42.439" end="02:43.120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">rita</span>
                            <span begin="02:43.120" end="02:43.390" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ka</span>
                            <span begin="02:43.390" end="02:43.784" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ta</span>
                        </text>
                    </transliteration>
                </transliterations>
                <translations>
                    <translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN">
                        <text for="L1">若等待终无改变</text>
                        <text for="L2">谁都不能依靠</text>
                        <text for="L3">就算归咎于他人这痛苦也不会消失</text>
                        <text for="L4">想告别只有抱膝蜷缩的每一天</text>
                        <text for="L5">明明根本不信什么神明</text>
                        <text for="L6">烦死了 别管我</text>
                        <text for="L7">素不相识的人嘶哑歌唱说你不孤独</text>
                        <text for="L8">声嘶力竭地唱着</text>
                        <text for="L9">这样的言语或许也能拯救某些生命吧</text>
                        <text for="L10">不明白 是这样吗 有这回事吗 忘了</text>
                        <text for="L11">真麻烦 想毁掉 却又没有勇气</text>
                        <text for="L12">谁来告诉我活下去的理由 快点</text>
                        <text for="L13">替代品要多少有多少</text>
                        <text for="L14">做自己哪能说得那么简单</text>
                        <text for="L15">若能如愿就请夺回</text>
                        <text for="L16">那充满梦想的真相</text>
                        <text for="L17">喂 有人在吗</text>
                        <text for="L18">从何时起一成不变的景色让我厌倦至极</text>
                        <text for="L19">对不变的景色已经彻底厌烦</text>
                        <text for="L20">尽是棘手之事高耸眼前 终结了理想</text>
                        <text for="L21">渴望更肮脏直击心底的像人说的话</text>
                        <text for="L22">沉沦 无光之海连声音也无法回响</text>
                        <text for="L23">刚以为接通就断裂的</text>
                        <text for="L24">复杂丝线纠缠不清</text>
                        <text for="L25">逃避现实苟活维系生命</text>
                        <text for="L26">不需要吧 我知道 无法正常行走</text>
                        <text for="L27">像傻瓜 像傻瓜 要怎么笑呢</text>
                        <text for="L28">听见了本应无尽的梦破碎的声音</text>
                        <text for="L29">欲哭无泪 差不多该好好活了吧</text>
                        <text for="L30">因为深陷溺水所以不知如何游泳</text>
                        <text for="L31">事到如今为何悲伤</text>
                        <text for="L32">其实也曾想像某人一样</text>
                        <text for="L33">获得幸福</text>
                    </translation>
                </translations>
            </iTunesMetadata>
        </metadata>
    </head>
    <body dur="02:43.784">
        <div begin="00:00.617" end="02:43.784">
            <p begin="00:00.617" end="00:03.667" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">
                <span begin="00:00.617" end="00:01.077">いつまで</span>
                <span begin="00:01.077" end="00:01.399">待っ</span>
                <span begin="00:01.399" end="00:01.679">たっ</span>
                <span begin="00:01.679" end="00:01.828">て</span>
                <span begin="00:01.828" end="00:02.654">何ひとつ</span>
                <span begin="00:02.654" end="00:03.504">変わらないんな</span>
                <span begin="00:03.504" end="00:03.667">ら</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="00:03.681" end="00:05.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">
                <span begin="00:03.681" end="00:04.942">どいつもコイツも</span>
                <span begin="00:04.942" end="00:05.299">アテに</span>
                <span begin="00:05.299" end="00:05.860">ならない</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="00:06.045" end="00:10.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">
                <span begin="00:06.045" end="00:06.406">そ</span>
                <span begin="00:06.406" end="00:06.891">もそも</span>
                <span begin="00:06.891" end="00:07.443">誰かの</span>
                <span begin="00:07.443" end="00:08.087">せいだと</span>
                <span begin="00:08.087" end="00:08.379">言っ</span>
                <span begin="00:08.379" end="00:08.710">たって</span>
                <span begin="00:08.710" end="00:09.639">この痛みは</span>
                <span begin="00:09.639" end="00:09.970">消え</span>
                <span begin="00:09.970" end="00:10.251">ないん</span>
                <span begin="00:10.251" end="00:10.611">だ</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="00:10.918" end="00:15.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">
                <span begin="00:10.918" end="00:11.185">じっと</span>
                <span begin="00:11.185" end="00:11.551">膝を</span>
                <span begin="00:11.551" end="00:12.148">抱えて</span>
                <span begin="00:12.148" end="00:12.969">うずくまる</span>
                <span begin="00:12.969" end="00:13.441">だけの</span>
                <span begin="00:13.606" end="00:14.324">毎日に</span>
                <span begin="00:14.324" end="00:14.914">さよなら</span>
                <span begin="00:14.914" end="00:15.377">したいと</span>
                <span begin="00:15.377" end="00:15.659">願</span>
                <span begin="00:15.659" end="00:15.968">う</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="00:16.052" end="00:20.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">
                <span begin="00:16.052" end="00:16.473">神</span>
                <span begin="00:16.473" end="00:16.882">様</span>
                <span begin="00:16.882" end="00:17.301">なんて</span>
                <span begin="00:17.301" end="00:17.797">これっ</span>
                <span begin="00:17.797" end="00:18.029">ぽっ</span>
                <span begin="00:18.029" end="00:18.410">ちも</span>
                <span begin="00:18.545" end="00:19.129">信じて</span>
                <span begin="00:19.129" end="00:19.761">ないくせ</span>
                <span begin="00:19.761" end="00:20.285">に</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="00:20.484" end="00:28.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">
                <span begin="00:20.484" end="00:20.788">うる</span>
                <span begin="00:20.788" end="00:21.181">さ</span>
                <span begin="00:21.181" end="00:21.706">いん</span>
                <span begin="00:21.706" end="00:21.998">だ</span>
                <span begin="00:21.998" end="00:23.888">よ </span>
                <span begin="00:25.641" end="00:25.861">ほっ</span>
                <span begin="00:25.861" end="00:26.189">とい</span>
                <span begin="00:26.189" end="00:26.555">て</span>
                <span begin="00:26.555" end="00:26.746">く</span>
                <span begin="00:26.746" end="00:27.077">れ</span>
                <span begin="00:27.077" end="00:28.335">よ</span>
            </p>
